# Tech stack (GFM)

| Layer        | Technology                                                                              |
| ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Runtime / PM | **Bun** — `bun install`, `bun run …`                                                    |
| UI           | **Vite** + **React 18** + **TypeScript**                                                |
| Routing      | **React Router 7** (`react-router-dom`) — `ui/src/routes/index.tsx` + feature `routes/` |
| Styling      | **Tailwind 3** + shadcn-style primitives (`ui/src/components/ui/`)                      |
| Forms        | **React Hook Form** + **Zod**                                                           |
| Server state | **TanStack Query v5** — feature `hooks/`                                                |
| Toasts       | **Sonner**                                                                              |
| Icons        | **Lucide**                                                                              |
| Backend      | **Supabase Edge Functions** (Deno) — no Node API, no tRPC, no Drizzle                   |
| DB           | Supabase Postgres — SQL migrations in `supabase/migrations/`                            |
| Auth         | Supabase Auth (Google OAuth for admin)                                                  |
| Storage      | Supabase Storage                                                                        |
| Email        | Resend from edge (`_shared/emailService.ts`)                                            |

## Commands

```bash
bun install
./dev.sh                 # Docker + local Supabase + UI
./dev.sh --ui-only       # UI only (remote Supabase)
bun run lint
bun run type-check
bun run build
bun run start:supabase   # Supabase only
```

## UI conventions

- Path alias: `@/` → `ui/src/`
- Single Supabase client: `ui/src/lib/supabase/client.ts`
- Admin API: `fetch` to `VITE_SUPABASE_URL/<function>` with session JWT, or `callEdgeFunction` in `ui/src/features/dashboard/org/lib/edgeClient.ts`
- Public guest API: anon key + edge functions (`submit-form`, `get-booked-dates`, …)
- Dates: user-visible **Asia/Manila**; DB guest fields often **MM-DD-YYYY** text — use `ui/src/utils/dates.ts` and `_shared/utils.ts`

## Do not introduce

Next.js, App Router, tRPC, Drizzle, React 19 RSC, Zustand (not used), separate `api/` package.
